# Flash-attention forward, warp-specialized: one persistent CTA walks
# tiles, two 4-warp partitions each own 64 query rows, mbarrier waits
# are scoped self-loops. Every trip count is unknown: the persistent
# tile loop has a latch per partition, the key loop's bound is the
# tile's query block and so the CTA index, the wait loops spin on
# `mbarrier.test_wait` (PLAN.md). Per key block per thread the
# partition body is 128 bf16 mma, 16384 tensor flops and 128 B of
# copies, bounded because SKIP_MASKED skips the masked half-block.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/gluon/attn_fwd_ws_kernel.sm_89.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: kernel attn_fwd_ws_kernel
CHECK: /-------------  <block 1>        gluon_attn_fwd.py:79-229       93  128 in 4 warps (⌊%tid.x/32⌋ < 4)             $L__BB0_62, <block 2>
CHECK: |  |      /---  <block 2>        gluon_attn_fwd.py:98-118       55  <= 128 in <= 4 warps (⌊%tid.x/32⌋ < 4)       $L__BB0_38, $L__tmp5
CHECK: block size: 256 threads, 8 warps (256x1x1 from .reqntid)
CHECK: loop gluon_attn_fwd.py:126 ($L__BB0_39)
CHECK: trips = unknown: loop exit is not at the latch
CHECK: loop gluon_attn_fwd.py:131 (waitLoop$scope1)
CHECK: trips = unknown: latch predicate is defined by `mbarrier.test_wait.parity.shared::cta.b64`, not a comparison
CHECK: loop gluon_attn_fwd.py:143 ($L__BB0_43)
CHECK: trips = unknown: latch condition depends on special register %ctaid.x
CHECK: mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.bf16.bf16.f32                                                              <= 128
CHECK: tensor flops = <= 16384  (bf16 <= 16384)
CHECK: global bytes: load <= 128 B, store 0 B
CHECK: loop gluon_attn_fwd.py:213 ($L__BB0_2)
CHECK: trips = unknown: loop has multiple latches
CHECK: totals per CTA [static]:
CHECK: tensor flops = <= 2097152 * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:143) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:126) + 2097152 * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213)  (bf16 <= 2097152 * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:143) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:126) + 2097152 * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213) * trips(gluon_attn_fwd.py:213))
CHECK: unknowns:
CHECK: coverage: instructions_classified 100.0% (2858/2858)
